{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jigsaw Rogue is a deck-building roguelike where you combine jigsaw puzzle pieces to battle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat where piece combinations are key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you place &quot;pieces&quot; with various abilities\u2014such as attack, defense, and buffs\u2014on a 4x4 board. Where will you place the pieces? Which pieces will you combine? If your strategy fits perfectly, the effects of the pieces will multiply several times over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721200/extras/a6495a92a0a83c54076669509d2dd891.avif?t=1771937162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721200/extras_big/a6495a92a0a83c54076669509d2dd891.avif?t=1771937162 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize the shape of your pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the deck-building phase, you can not only acquire new pieces but also change the shape of the pieces (the number of protrusions and indentations). Pieces with more connections offer more possibilities for powerful combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A compact and accessible game system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a deck-building roguelike, the rules of this game are relatively simple. By minimizing complex mechanics and difficult jargon, the game is designed to let you dive straight into the fun of combining pieces. It's perfect for a quick and casual play session between other games.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2721200?t=1771937162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2721200?t=1771937162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721200/49de68e6431caec8f9b8d3bb3e21307ca3215c61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771937162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721200/49de68e6431caec8f9b8d3bb3e21307ca3215c61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771937162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jigsaw Rogue is a deck-building roguelike where you combine jigsaw puzzle pieces to battle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat where piece combinations are key</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you place &quot;pieces&quot; with various abilities\u2014such as attack, defense, and buffs\u2014on a 4x4 board. Where will you place the pieces? Which pieces will you combine? If your strategy fits perfectly, the effects of the pieces will multiply several times over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721200/extras/a6495a92a0a83c54076669509d2dd891.avif?t=1771937162\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721200/extras_big/a6495a92a0a83c54076669509d2dd891.avif?t=1771937162 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize the shape of your pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the deck-building phase, you can not only acquire new pieces but also change the shape of the pieces (the number of protrusions and indentations). Pieces with more connections offer more possibilities for powerful combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A compact and accessible game system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a deck-building roguelike, the rules of this game are relatively simple. By minimizing complex mechanics and difficult jargon, the game is designed to let you dive straight into the fun 